stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Funding: createCampaign and deposit
    Funding --> Failed: deadline, goal missed
    Funding --> Active: deadline, goal met
    Active --> ChallengeWindow: deliver
    ChallengeWindow --> Released: window ends, no quorum
    ChallengeWindow --> Canceled: object above half of totalRaised
    Released --> Active: more milestones
    Released --> Completed: last milestone
